      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '- Find controls in the left side of the screen

    - There are 3 big
    areas, each has its own purpose:


    1. Stacking Games

    You can try out
    what games are possible to create with this engine


    2. Game Mechanics

    Some
    of the most important mechanics are grabbed out of the games and explained here.
    It can be useful to examine how each mechanic handles its own purpose


    3.
    UI Mechanics

    Understanding and clarity is the purpose of this area, just
    as the previous one''s. The only difference is these mechanics are related to
    the user interface


    The engine will be updated with new games and mechanics
    regularly.'
